---
import "../styles/rs4.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Tack Test | RingStatus</title>
    <meta name="description" content="RS4 Webflow Cloud Astro landing-page test." />
  </head>

  <body class="rs4-body">
    <main class="rs4-page">

      <section class="rs4-sec is-hero">
        <div class="rs4-flexv-v">
          <h1 class="rs4-h1">I built this because being ready matters.</h1>

          <p class="rs4-lede">
            I am a junior rider and working student. I ride a lot, work a lot, and spend enough time at shows to know when something is making the day harder than it needs to be.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="rs4-sec">
        <div class="rs4-flexv-h">
          <div class="rs3-col-left">
            <h2 class="rs4-h2">Show days are not calm.</h2>

            <p class="rs4-body2">
              Show days are not calm. You still have to be ready. I started building simple tools because I needed a better way to keep track of horses, timing, packing, grooms, and rings without digging through a heavy app every five minutes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rs3-col-right">
            <div class="rs3-img-wrapper">
              <img
                class="rs3-image-screen1"
                src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6982268b7543ac3c80151266/69ef980833ad820a005542da_ring6.avif"
                alt=""
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="rs4-sec is-short">
        <div class="pwr-card-shell is-wide">
          <div class="pwr-slider-actions">
            <h3 class="rs4-h3">Barn Tools</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="pwr-card-lane hide-scrollbar">
            <div class="pwr-card">
              <a href="#" class="card-link on-secondary">
                <div class="rs2-card3">
                  <h4 class="rs4-h4">I work a lot.</h4>
                  <p class="rs4-para2">
                    I pack, prep, check timing, help with horses, and keep moving when the day changes.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="pwr-card">
              <a href="#" class="card-link on-secondary">
                <div class="rs2-card3">
                  <h4 class="rs4-h4">I ride a lot.</h4>
                  <p class="rs4-para2">
                    I ride different types, including the hard ones, and I learn fast because I have to.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="pwr-card">
              <a href="#" class="card-link on-secondary">
                <div class="rs2-card3">
                  <h4 class="rs4-h4">I had help building it.</h4>
                  <p class="rs4-para2">
                    I bring the show-day problems from the barn. My dad helps turn them into simple tools that work.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="rs4-sec is-short">
        <div class="rs4-flexv-v">
          <div class="eyebrow-2">Mission</div>

          <h3 class="rs4-h3">Not fancy. Just useful.</h3>

          <p class="rs4-body2">
            This was not something handed off to a developer. It came from real show weeks, long days, moving rings, and needing better answers fast.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>
  </body>
</html>